user cnb-vagrant
topic read cnb/vagrant/config/set
topic read cnb/vagrant/command
topic write cnb/vagrant/telemetry
topic write cnb/vagrant/config/state
topic write cnb/vagrant/command/state
topic write cnb/vagrant/status

user cnb-dashboard
topic write cnb/vagrant/config/set
topic write cnb/vagrant/command
topic read cnb/vagrant/telemetry
topic read cnb/vagrant/config/state
topic read cnb/vagrant/command/state
topic read cnb/vagrant/status
topic write cnb/ford/command
topic write cnb/ford/config/set
topic read cnb/ford/telemetry
topic read cnb/ford/config/state
topic read cnb/ford/command/state
topic read cnb/ford/status
topic read cnb/ford/pi/telemetry
topic read cnb/ford/pi/status

user cnb-ford
topic read cnb/ford/command
topic read cnb/ford/config/set
topic write cnb/ford/telemetry
topic write cnb/ford/config/state
topic write cnb/ford/command/state
topic write cnb/ford/status
# The Ford's Raspberry Pi logs in as cnb-ford too, with its own client ID (cnb-ford-pi).
topic write cnb/ford/pi/telemetry
topic write cnb/ford/pi/status
